                            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">
                                Filed under Section 71 before the designated Judicial Adjudicating Officer (a retired District Judge). Specifically designed to quantify compensation, damages, interest on losses, and mental harassment claims under Sections 12, 14, 18, and 19.
