                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark-navy mb-1"><i class="fas fa-scale-balanced text-gold me-2"></i> Appeals before TNREAT &amp; Madras High Court</h4>
                            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">
                                Any person aggrieved by an order of TNRERA or the Adjudicating Officer may prefer an appeal within 60 days before the Tamil Nadu Real Estate Appellate Tribunal (TNREAT) under Section 44. Promoters appealing an order must pre-deposit at least 30% of the penalty or the total awarded amount before the appeal is entertained (Section 43(5)). Second appeals lie before the Madras High Court under Section 58 on substantial questions of law.
